emanded to be next in line for the throne. After years of hard work, I finally became empress and died happily. But here I am, alive again. Ugh, can’t a girl be left alone? This time, I’m going to be as lazy as I please!\n\n---\n[Original Novel](https://page.kakao.com/home?seriesId=52334485)\n\n**Original Webtoon:** [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%A7%8C%EB%A0%99-%EA%B3%B5%EB%85%80%EB%8A%94-%EC%98%A4%EB%8A%98%EB%8F%84-%EB%AC%B4%EB%A3%8C%ED%95%98%EB%8B%A4/2751), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/home/58873967)\n\n**Official Translations:**\n* [English](https://tapas.io/series/the-dukes-bored-daughter-is-my-master/info)\n* [Chinese (Simplified) / 汉语](https://pdt.tencentac.com/?adtag=appshare.ios.detail%26QQ%26241&contentId=241&platform=IA)\n* [Chinese (Traditional) / 漢語](https://tw.kakaowebtoon.com/content/%E6%BB%BF%E7%AD%89%E5%8D%83%E9%87%91%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%AD%E4%B8%96/302)\n* [Indonesian / Bahasa Indonesia](https://id.kakaowebtoon.com/content/Tuan-Putri-Jagoan-Sedang-Bosan-Hari-Ini/115)\n* [Japanese / 日本語](https://piccoma.com/web/product/103342)\n* [Thai / ภาษาไทย](https://th.kakaowebtoon.com/content/%E0%B8%8A%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%A7%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%95%E0%B8%97%E0%B8%B5%E0%B9%88%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%82%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%94%E0%B8%B5%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B8%E0%B8%94%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%87/402)	2022-01-01 00:00:00	\N	69	\N	\N	https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/1d40f81e-fecd-4413-9180-801fe757fde4/eb08a8fc-8582-4787-a7e8-e13d9d23d93c.jpg	\N	{Reincarnation,Action,"Long Strip",Romance,Comedy,"Martial Arts",Adventure,Drama,Fantasy,"Web Comic",Adaptation,"Full Color"}	{}	\N	0	0	MANGADEX	KR	2026-06-01 16:33:13.997991-05	2026-06-15 15:54:06.785443-05
