ao.com/content/%EC%95%84%EB%B9%A0-%EB%82%98-%EC%9D%B4-%EA%B2%B0%ED%98%BC-%EC%95%88-%ED%95%A0%EB%9E%98%EC%9A%94/2472), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/56556599)\n\n**Official Translations:**\n* [English](https://www.tappytoon.com/en/comics/father-i-dont-want-this-marriage)\n* [Chinese (Simplified) / 汉语](https://www.kuaikanmanhua.com/web/topic/9772/)\n* [Chinese (Traditional) / 漢語](https://tw.kakaowebtoon.com/content/%E7%88%B8%E7%88%B8%E6%88%91%E4%B8%8D%E6%83%B3%E7%B5%90%E5%A9%9A/101)\n* [French / Français](https://www.tappytoon.com/fr/comics/father-i-dont-want-this-marriage-fr)\n* [German / Deutsch](https://www.tappytoon.com/de/comics/father-i-dont-want-this-marriage-de)\n* [Indonesian / Bahasa Indonesia](https://id.kakaowebtoon.com/content/Ayah-Aku-Tidak-Mau-Menikah/37)\n* [Japanese / 日本語](https://piccoma.com/web/product/66124)\n* [Thai / ภาษาไทย](https://th.kakaowebtoon.com/content/%E0%B8%97%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%9E%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%AD_%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%B9%E0%B8%81%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%A1%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%81%E0%B9%81%E0%B8%95%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%99/125)	2021-01-01 00:00:00	\N	131	\N	\N	https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/e1847df1-db22-4279-95e2-9dbbbd1bbfbc/4467374b-af72-4c49-8fdd-d95988ffcb1a.jpg	\N	{Reincarnation,"Long Strip",Romance,Isekai,Drama,Fantasy,Villainess,"Web Comic",Adaptation,"Full Color"}	{}	\N	0	0	MANGADEX	KR	2026-06-01 16:33:13.879388-05	2026-06-15 15:54:06.678128-05
