196581458	The Villainess Is a Marionette	The Villainess Is a Marionette		MANHWA	MANGA	FINISHED	"Beauty cannot be real power."\n\nCayena, the Imperial Princess, was known as the most beautiful woman in the Empire. She was a woman who knew nothing but evil and luxury. However, she was destined for ruin: she would be used as a chess piece by her younger brother to secure his throne and killed by her crazy husband.\n\n"I'll make you the emperor."\n\n"…Sister, you're going to make me the emperor?"\n\n"In exchange, give me freedom."\n\nShe had to change things before she became *that* Cayena.\n\n---\nI woke up as Kayena Hill, the novel’s villainess, praised as the greatest beauty in the empire. Who knew that her story would catch my attention because I was her in my past life? Destined for terrible ends, I’ve died twice—but I refuse to die a third time as a pawn in someone else’s scheme. I’m no longer the vain and naïve princess. Now that I know how the story will unfold, I’ll turn the tables around and have everyone dancing to my tune. This time, I’ll be the one pulling the strings.\n\n---\n**Original Webtoon:** [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%95%85%EB%85%80%EB%8A%94-%EB%A7%88%EB%A6%AC%EC%98%A4%EB%84%A4%ED%8A%B8/2464), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/56422254)\n\n**Official Translations:**\n* English: [Radish](https://radishfiction.com/stories/17106), [Tapas](https://tapas.io/series/the-villainess-is-a-marionette/info) [Yenpress (vol)](https://yenpress.com/series/the-villainess-is-a-marionette)\n* [Chinese (Simplified) / 汉语](https://www.podoteng.com/)\n* [Chinese (Traditional) / 漢語](https://tw.kakaowebtoon.com/content/%E6%83%A1%E5%A5%B3%E6%98%AF%E6%87%B8%E7%B5%B2%E6%9C%A8%E5%81%B6/94)\n* [French / Français](https://fr.piccoma.com/fr/product/231)\n* [Indonesian / Bahasa Indonesia](https://id.kakaowebtoon.com/content/The-Villainess-is-a-Marionette/40)\n* [Japanese / 日本語](https://piccoma.com/web/product/67171)\n* [Thai / ภาษาไทย](https://th.kakaowebtoon.com/content/%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%A3%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%B8%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%99%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%8A%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%94/117)	2021-01-01 00:00:00	\N	111	\N	\N	https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/a82fe527-9e74-48d0-9c5f-a5e788c0bd4a/c62f9627-3690-47f4-b0cd-0060e379eb8b.jpg	\N	{Reincarnation,"Long Strip",Romance,Magic,Isekai,Drama,Fantasy,Villainess,"Web Comic",Adaptation,"Full Color"}	{}	\N	0	0	MANGADEX	KR	2026-06-01 16:33:13.879388-05	2026-06-15 15:54:06.678128-05
200449186	A Wicked Tale of Cinderella's Stepmom	A Wicked Tale of Cinderella's Stepmom		MANHWA	MANGA	HIATUS	There is a famous fairytale. A kindhearted girl whose father and stepmother got married and became a family of five with her two stepsisters. The poor girl who was condemned by her stepmother and stepsisters when her father died. The very fairytale, Cinderella. But I am not Cinderella, I am the stepmother. At the age of thirty-seven, already married twice, been widowed twice and is raising three daughters!  \n  \nDaniel Walford, a man who keeps approaching me while I’m busy trying to raise my three daughters.  \n“Can I kiss you?”  \nAs a son-in law, I think he’s a little bit older but why does he keep approaching?… Oh, I don’t know.  \nOnce I let Cinderella marry the prince, I can live quietly.  \nBut is this fairytale really ‘Cinderella’?\n\n---\n\n- Updates every Sunday in the Kakao Page	2020-01-01 00:00:00	\N	\N	\N	\N	https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/fdaa7d42-29bb-4cf2-b635-96d57732f1be/c0494002-a6c4-4a13-863f-6880abec6ed1.jpg	\N	{Reincarnation,"Long Strip",Romance,Magic,Isekai,Drama,Fantasy,Villainess,Adaptation,"Full Color"}	{}	\N	0	0	MANGADEX	KR	2026-06-01 16:33:13.879388-05	2026-06-15 15:54:06.678128-05
200803042				MANHWA	MANGA	RELEASING	When I opened my eyes, I had become a princess! But out of all the characters from this romance novel to be reborn into, why must it be the princess whose fate it is to die by the hands of her own blood-related father, the emperor?! If I want to live, I must never enter his sight. However…  \n\n"Since when did this kind of scumbag start living in my castle?"\n\nWithout a single tear to shed nor a drop of blood to spill, that cruel and cold emperor, Claude! Will I, the Princess Athanasia who was caught by him, survive?\n\n"I… What should I do…"\n\n---\nThe beautiful Athanasia was killed at the hands of her own biological father, Claude de Alger Obelia, the cold-blooded emperor! It’s just a silly bedtime story… until one woman wakes up to suddenly find she’s become that unfortunate princess! She needs a plan to survive her doomed fate, and time is running out. \n\nWill she go with Plan A, live as quietly as possible without being noticed by the infamous emperor? Plan B, collect enough money to escape the palace? Or will she be stuck with Plan C, sweet-talking her way into her father’s good graces?!\n\n\n---\n**Original Webtoon:** [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/51880368), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.nhn?productNo=3903318), [RidiBooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3240000001)\n\n**Official Translations:**\n* [English](https://www.tappytoon.com/series/whoprincess/1)\n* [Chinese (Simplified) / 汉语](http://kuaikanmanhua.com/web/topic/2991/)\n* [Chinese (Traditional) / 漢語](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/drama/princessnasi/list?title_no=1618)\n* [French / Français](http://delitoon.com/webtoon/dites-moi-princesse)\n* [German / Deutsch](https://altraverse.de/manga/athanasia-ploetzlich-prinzessin/)\n* [Indonesian / Bahasa Indonesia](https://www.webtoons.com/id/fantasy/became-a-princess/list?title_no=1588)\n* [Japanese / 日本語](https://piccoma.com/web/product/13034)\n* [Thai / ภาษาไทย](https://www.webtoons.co