ve more. The desire that he had, faded for a while.\n\n“I didn’t really want anything, but now I think I do.”	2022-01-01 00:00:00	\N	59	\N	\N	https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/95a10c9f-3836-4b62-86f8-eefe6688df41/c7a49587-a793-4385-b587-0ee579ed4bf9.jpg	\N	{Reincarnation,Historical,"Long Strip",Romance,Comedy,Isekai,Drama,Fantasy,"Web Comic",Adaptation,"Full Color"}	{}	\N	0	0	MANGADEX	KR	2026-06-15 15:54:07.025636-05	2026-06-15 15:54:07.025636-05
