236122972				MANHWA	MANGA	RELEASING	Q: Describe your feelings upon discovering your trusted dad isn’t just an extra.\nA: W-what the heck... Give me back my ‘Random Imperial Citizen #1’ life...\n\nLiving in a world of constant war—365 days of chaos—a simple, extra's existence was a blessing.\nAt least, that's what I thought.\n\nIn a small village, I enjoyed a humble life with my loving, ordinary father, James Brown, 27, the epitome of an unremarkable single dad.\n\nOr so I believed.\n\n“Ladies and gentlemen, presenting my father! The quintessential symbol of extras everywhere! Brown hair, brown eyes, plain and simple!”\n“...”\n“This man screams ‘background character,’ living a quiet life chopping wood in a mountain village with his adorable daughter. Right? ...RIGHT?”\n\nThe knight commander merely stared at me in silence.\n\nAnd then, the unthinkable happened.\n\nBehind me, my father’s worn staff began to glow with a strange, blue aura.\n\n“...Dad?”\n\nBefore I could process what was happening, his unassuming brown hair and eyes shifted. Slowly but surely, they transformed into...\n\nShimmering silver locks and piercing blue eyes—practically shouting “I’m the protagonist!”\n\n“WHAT?!”\n\nMy simple, extra life shattered into a million pieces as my dad—no, this mysterious powerhouse—gripped his weapon and snarled:\n“Give me back my daughter, you bastard.”\n\n---\nDeserting the battlefield, Enoch Rubinstein flees with his newborn daughter Lilith to a small village to raise her disguised as James Brown, a regular, doting single father. But when the order of knights returns to drag Enoch back to the capital, Lilith finds that her father was secretly one of the empire's greatest heroes. As her father's daughter, she also discovers that she holds great potential. Will Lilith be able to keep her family safe? Or will the secrets lurking ahead overpower her?	2024-01-01 00:00:00	\N	\N	\N	\N	https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/703b45a0-1c73-436f-9c07-03d31053b4d0/79d15ba6-dfb3-