r family, she has no choice but to be nice to him. It's easy enough to avoid him at first, but this becomes harder when they start attending the same academy. Will Obet be able to keep Hinn from exposing her secret, despite the fact that he seems to be on a mission to annoy her 24/7?\n\n---\n**Original Novel:** [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/54162322), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=8555785), [RidiBooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1629003272)\n\n**Original Webtoon:** [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=220267), [Boomtoon](https://bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/D_H_noF), [Comico](https://www.comico.kr/comic/8295), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/59594840), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/dont_call_friend), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000052887), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8561523), [RidiBooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1180012060)\n\n**Official Translations:**\n* English: [NetComics](https://www.netcomics.com/comic/17657), [Tappytoon](https://www.tappytoon.com/en/comics/can-the-grand-duke-and-the-marquis-be-friends)\n* Chinese / 汉语: [BiliBili](https://manga.bilibili.com/detail/mc32745), [KuaiKan](https://www.kuaikanmanhua.com/web/topic/16945/), [PODO](https://pdt.tencentac.com/?adtag=appshare.ios.detail%26QQ%26320&contentId=320&platform=IA)\n* [French / Français](https://www.tappytoon.com/fr/comics/can-the-grand-duke-and-the-marquis-be-friends-fr)\n* [German / Deutsch](https://www.tappytoon.com/de/comics/can-the-grand-duke-and-the-marquis-be-friends-de)\n* [Indonesian / Bahasa Indonesia](https://www.webtoons.com/id/romantic-fantasy/can-the-grand-duke-and-the-marquis-be-friends/list?title_no=4796)\n* [Japanese / 日本語](https://www.lezhin.jp/ja/comic/taikouto)	2022-01-01 00:00:00	\N	60	\N	\N	https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/d5844d14-8121-4741-b6a5-bcb6647899bf/b322fb7f-496d-47d1-8efe-524133e12616.jpg	\N	{"Long Strip