238771128	One Step Forward to the Flower Path	One Step Forward to the Flower Path		MANHWA	MANGA	RELEASING	I lived my whole life being used by other people and died at the age of sixteen. I thought it would be over like that, but when I opened my eyes again, I was back in the past. I thought I'd die while living the rest of my life in pain one more time. \n\nBut suddenly, a father who I had never seen before appeared before me. My dad, whom I hadn't even known existed.\n\n===\n\n"When are you going to take away my powers?"\n\nDante's eyes shook greatly at Ivanna's words.\n\n"Everyone did. You, when will you take it?"\n\n"…I won't."\n\n"Why?"\n\nIvanna couldn't understand. Everyone coveted her power. Everyone wanted it, saying she was a sacrifice sent by God for humans. So why does he refuse?\n\n"No one will take your power now. No one will bother you. I'll protect you."\n\n"You're trying to take my power."\n\n"I'm not."\n\n"Everyone said that and stole my power from me. They locked me up in prison."\n\nIt was too cruel for a mere five-year-old to say. But the young Ivanna's face had no emotion as if what she said were natural. Dante's heart eventually collapsed when he saw his daughter completely shattered.\n\n---\nAbducted from her mother at a young age and tortured for her incredible power, Evanna knew nothing but agony her whole life. That is until one day, she is rescued and returned to the father she never knew, the Duke of Vicente. But as Evanna’s very existence brings back painful memories for the Duke, he must learn how to love her, while Evanna must come to trust her father and heal her trauma. But with Evanna's power highly coveted, can these two overcome their thorny pasts for a rosier future?\n\n---\n**Original Webtoon:** [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EA%BD%83%EA%B8%B8%EA%B9%8C%EC%A7%80-%EC%95%9E%EC%9C%BC%EB%A1%9C-%ED%95%9C-%EA%B1%B8%EC%9D%8C/2845), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/home?seriesId=58273697)\n\n**Official Translations:**\n* [English](https://tapas.io/series/everythings-coming-up-roses)\n* [Chinese (Simplified) / 汉语](https://www.podoteng.com/)\n* [Chinese (Traditional) / 漢語](https://tw.kakaowebtoon.com/content/%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%E4%B9%8B%E9%81%99%E7%9A%84%E5%B9%B8%E7%A6%8F/282)\n* [Indonesian / Bahasa Indonesia](https://id.kakaowebtoon.com/content/One-More-Step-to-the-Flowery-Path/93)\n* [Japanese / 日本語](https://piccoma.com/web/product/89964)	2021-01-01 00:00:00	\N	\N	\N	\N	https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/0d3e7438-3393-4fd7-952a-99df634f4ca3/c496236c-3586-4bcc-94d5-69a304f0e283.jpg	\N	{Historical,"Long Strip",Romance,Magic,Fantasy,Adaptation,"Full Color"}	{}	\N	0	0	MANGADEX	KR	2026-06-15 15:54:07.411415-05	2026-06-15 15:54:07.411415-05
